C PAION0 [a.u.]   D-T	Fusion power fraction deposited to ions
C Mikkelsen,Singer with corrected missprint	  A.Polevoi 06-JUL-99
        y2 = 88./TE(J) 
        PAION0 = sqrt(y2)
        PAION0=2.*(0.166666667*LOG((1-PAION0+y2)/(1.+2.*PAION0+y2))+
     + 0.57735026*(ATAN( 0.57735026*(2.*PAION0-1.) )+0.52359874) ) / y2
